  "internal_note": "The account for user_id 10 is disabled (offboarded; title shows 'former'). Following KB-005, I did not run a reset, unlock or re-enable. Sign-in logs show 2 failed-password VPN attempts on 2026-10-09 at 07:05 and 07:07 UTC from Amsterdam, NL (IP 192.0.2.140, hosting network, no MFA). That was 03:05 ET, outside his usual hours, and could be someone trying stolen credentials. Also, vpn_access=true and sign_in_blocked=false are still set on the disabled account, so the VPN entitlement should be removed. The request came from the mailbox of a disabled account, so the sender's identity is not verified. Reactivation needs HR and manager confirmation plus a callback to the number on file. Escalated to Tier 2 (escalation 1) with these details for security review.",
